The .pic files in this directory tree are redistributed, unmodified, from the
dpic distribution by J. D. Aplevich (https://gitlab.com/aplevich/dpic), where
they live under examples/ and doc/. They were compared byte for byte with the
upstream repository at commit 1354b63eb7120e5d0d40855c18d69e413a636ef2
(2025-07-31). The .svg files next to them are rpic's output.

dpic's licence terms are in the file Copyright.txt of its distribution
(https://gitlab.com/aplevich/dpic/-/blob/master/Copyright.txt). The two
stanzas that apply to these files are reproduced verbatim below: the one
that states the copyright and licence of "all [files] except as noted", and
the text of that licence. None of the files that Copyright.txt lists under
another licence (dpic-doc.pdf, doc/dpictools.pic, dpic.tab.*, the autoconf
scripts, debian/*) is included here.

